        "paragraph_id": null,
        "text": "XBeach is currently formulated using depth averaged quantities and therefore the momentum equations (1.4) are integrated over the water depth. Because the procedure is very similar for each of the three momentum equations only the u-momentum equation will be dealt with in detail."
      },
